<title>USA: Tulsa Cty, Okla., schools won by Dain at 4.79 pct.</title>
<headline>Tulsa Cty, Okla., schools won by Dain at 4.79 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said Tuesday it won $42 million Independent School District No 1, Okla., bonds at a net interest cost of 4.79 percent.</p>
